

# <type>[optional (<scope>)]: <subject>
#
# Types:
#   feat     : new user-facing feature
#   fix      : bug fix
#   refactor : code change without behavior change
#   perf     : performance improvement
#   docs     : README, feature docs, CHANGELOG
#   test     : add or update tests
#   style    : formatting/whitespace only (not UI/CSS)
#   build    : Vite, bundler, or build config
#   ci       : CI/CD or deployment workflows
#   chore    : deps, tooling, git, maintenance
#   revert   : revert a previous commit
#
# Scopes (optional):
#   upload, parser, pdf, history, ui, i18n, theme, guide, a11y, docs, deps, config
#
# Rules:
#   - Subject: English, imperative, lowercase, no trailing period (aim <= 50 chars, max 72)
#   - Body   : optional, explain WHY not WHAT, wrap at 72 chars
#   - Footer : optional, e.g. BREAKING CHANGE: ... or Closes #123
#   - Update CHANGELOG.md ([Unreleased]) for notable user-facing changes
#
# Examples:
#   feat(upload): add drag-and-drop ZIP support
#   fix(parser): handle nested folder paths in Instagram export
#   docs(readme): clarify local history consent flow
#   chore(deps): bump fflate to 0.8.4
